<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB picks 12 Euro stocks for 1997.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB picks 12 Euro stocks for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategist David Aserkoff at CS First Boston on Monday named 12 European stocks he expected to outperform during 1997.</p>
<p>Aserkoff said his favourite stocks for the year were Italian luxury goods maker Gucci, French luxury goods company LVMH, Danish pharmaceutical group Novo Nordisk, British Telecommunications, French TV broadcaster Canal Plus, Philips Electronics of the Netherlands, Germany's Commerzbank, French insurer Axa, German conglomerate RWE, German engineering group Mannesmann, Volkswagen of Germany and French oil group Elf Aquitaine.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
